### Formato de Documentación

#### Ataque Simulado
```yaml
technique_id: T1003.001
technique_name: OS Credential Dumping: LSASS Memory
tactic: Credential Access
tool: atomic-red-team
command: Invoke-AtomicTest T1003.001
timestamp: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS
status: executed
artifacts:
  - lsass.dmp
  - process_list.txt
```

#### Detección Validada
```yaml
technique_id: T1003.001
detection_sources:
  - source: Sysmon
    event_id: 10
    detected: true
    time_to_detect: 2m
  - source: EDR
    alert: LSASS Access
    detected: true
    time_to_detect: 30s
coverage: 100%
false_positives: 0
```

#### Brecha Identificada
```yaml
technique_id: T1055.001
technique_name: Process Injection: DLL Injection
gap_type: No Detection
severity: High
recommendation: |
  Implementar regla Sigma para detectar:
  - CreateRemoteThread hacia procesos críticos
